# An X session on Dolly's display: the Xsdl server, twm managing the
# windows, and three of X's own clients in theirs: a clock, eyes that follow
# the pointer and a terminal with a shell, where imgui-x11 starts Dear ImGui's
# example in a window of its own.
FROM /v0.1.4/Dollyfile-system f36768a8d5103e5d0174be6a7eca40452e7ade6cdf41cf8a6bb4c378e05dd20f
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xorg-server 7243560d399098361e20dedcea768cafc069f23239ec667291018bd15711f04c
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-twm 8b4395da10a61b65b30c4c2c360b0be8bd28bb8fc06dee09a4e9ab24e8b76de1
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xclock 98efa1df43f5f0eeb831d6eaa5e4093c795e28f5f6b56bf6c05a69209b4592cb
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xeyes e090266016a453d1fc294266ca7a000b99a8cef273c0686922153ae9840a8b4b
